      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_answer_01",
      "hash64": "A5BC9097F6D8D2BA",
      "text": "¡Respuesta correcta! Veo que tu imaginación te\\nsirve bien, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_answer_02",
      "hash64": "A5BC8F97F6D8D107",
      "text": "¿Una oreja trilobulada?\\c\\nBueno, si la pregunta fuese sobre Chansey, quizá\\nfuese la respuesta correcta. Pero no es el caso.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_answer_03",
      "hash64": "A5BC8E97F6D8CF54",
      "text": "¿Una cola trifurcada?\\c\\nBueno, si la pregunta fuese sobre Tauros, tal vez\\nfuese la respuesta correcta. Pero no es el caso.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_15",
      "hash64": "F723C35829571EA8",
      "text": "El risco de tres picos de Sierra Napada recibe el\\nnombre de la [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Mano de Napada[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_16",
      "hash64": "F723C658295723C1",
      "text": "Aunque sería una mano un tanto rechoncha para\\nser humana. Habremos de asumir que se referían\\r\\na la mano de un Pokémon cuando la bautizaron.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_17",
      "hash64": "F723C5582957220E",
      "text": "También están las montañas del Área 3 del este,\\ndesde las que se aprecia Ciudad Leudal.\\c\\nUna vista de particular belleza caída la noche.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_18",
      "hash64": "F723C0582957198F",
      "text": "Tanto es así que se ha ganado el nombre de\\nla [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Gran Luminaria Nocturna[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_19",
      "hash64": "F723BF58295717DC",
      "text": "Tengo entendido que se trata de un lugar muy\\nfrecuentado por parejas de enamorados.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_20",
      "hash64": "F7193658294DDA8C",
      "text": "Como diríais los jóvenes de hoy, es una estampa\\nde selfi... Se dice así, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_21",
      "hash64": "F7193758294DDC3F",
      "text": "Debo aclarar que, aunque las llamen maravillas,\\nes posible que al verlas no os parezcan para\\r\\ntanto, o que directamente os decepcionen.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_22",
      "hash64": "F7193858294DDDF2",
      "text": "Pero no me malinterpretéis; no estoy insinuando\\nque no debáis visitarlas. Tan solo que templéis\\r\\nvuestras expectativas.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_23",
      "hash64": "F7193958294DDFA5",
      "text": "Lo importante es verlas en persona y juzgar por\\nuno mismo.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_24",
      "hash64": "F7193258294DD3C0",
      "text": "Incluso una experiencia decepcionante puede\\ndepararos algo positivo. ¡Comprobadlo si no![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
